# Phase plan files, one per line, in execution order, relative to the project
# root. Lines starting with # are comments. Append new phases at the end: a
# re-run skips every phase already recorded in .phase-runner/state/phases-done
# (keyed by this path — renaming a file makes it look new).
#
# Options after the path override runner.env for that phase only:
#   model= effort=              the builder          (e.g. a config-only phase on claude-sonnet-5)
#   fix_model= fix_effort=      its fix rounds
#   review_model= review_effort= its reviewer
# Spend the top effort on the hard phases, not on every phase:
#   docs/phases/PHASE-2-CORE-ENGINE.md   effort=xhigh
#   docs/phases/PHASE-7-RELEASE.md       model=claude-sonnet-5 effort=medium review_effort=medium
docs/phases/PHASE-0.md
docs/phases/PHASE-1.md
